  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0 - Initial Release\n🚀 Killer Feature: Paste any curl command and it works!\n✅ All 300+ curl options supported\n✅ Stream-based for memory efficiency\n✅ Perfect IntelliSense with full documentation\n✅ Every curl error code has its own exception\n✅ Middleware and DI support\n💎 Sponsored by IronSoftware\n\nFor full documentation and examples, visit https://github.com/jacob-mellor/curl-dot-net",
